sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant FSM as FiniteStateMachine
    participant Sel as initialStateSelector : InitialStateSelector
    participant Cur as currentState : StateNode
    participant T as Transition
    participant Trig as Trigger
    participant G as Guard
    participant Act as Action
    participant Next as to : StateNode

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Client, Next: 進場流程（新增：透過 InitialStateSelector 動態決定初始子狀態）
    Client ->> FSM: onEnter(event)
    activate FSM
    FSM ->> Sel: select(event)
    activate Sel
    Note over Sel: 根據 event 當下的條件（例如線上人數、是否已有人在廣播）\n即時評估，回傳這次應該進入的子狀態
    Sel -->> FSM: chosenState : StateNode
    deactivate Sel
    FSM ->> FSM: currentState = chosenState
    FSM ->> Cur: onEnter(event)
    activate Cur
    Note over Cur: 若 chosenState 本身也是 FiniteStateMachine，\n這裡會遞迴觸發它自己的「進場流程」，一路往下決定任意深度的子狀態
    Cur -->> FSM:
    deactivate Cur
    deactivate FSM
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
    Note over Client, Next: 轉移流程（新增：先往內委派給 currentState，處理不了才輪到自己這層）
    Client ->> FSM: fire(event)
    activate FSM

    FSM ->> Cur: fire(event)
    activate Cur
    Note over Cur: 多型呼叫：若 Cur 是 State，固定回傳 false；\n若 Cur 本身是 FiniteStateMachine，會真的去比對它自己的 Transition[]，\n甚至繼續往更深層委派（event bubbling，innermost-first）
    Cur -->> FSM: handled : bool
    deactivate Cur

    alt handled == true
        FSM -->> Client: true
    else handled == false

    loop 依序檢查 transitions
        FSM ->> T: isApplicable(currentState, event)
        activate T
        T ->> T: currentState == from ?
        T ->> Trig: isTriggeredBy(event)
        activate Trig
        Trig -->> T: bool
        deactivate Trig
        T ->> G: isSatisfied(event)
        activate G
        G -->> T: bool
        deactivate G
        T -->> FSM: applicable = true/false
        deactivate T
    end

    alt 找到 applicable transition
        FSM ->> Cur: onExit(event)
        activate Cur
        Cur -->> FSM:
        deactivate Cur

        opt transition 有 action
            FSM ->> Act: execute(event)
            activate Act
            Act -->> FSM:
            deactivate Act
        end

        FSM ->> Next: onEnter(event)
        activate Next
        Note over Next: 這裡就是最上面那段「進場流程」──\n代表每次透過 Transition 換到新狀態，一樣要重新問一次 InitialStateSelector，\n而不是沿用建構時寫死的初始狀態
        Next -->> FSM:
        deactivate Next

        FSM -->> Client: true
    else 無 applicable transition
        FSM -->> Client: false
    end

    end

    deactivate FSM
    end